{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Resolve test payloads with the operation-level offloader.** This always uses the global offloader. A step configured with its own offloader\u2014especially when no global offloader exists\u2014runs successfully but `TestOperation.getStepResult()` fails because the runner cannot resolve its envelope. Retain the selected offloader per operation and use it here, with coverage for both override and disabled precedence.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7obaxH","finding_digest":"84c89590f91ab4eda6a8ef8abbe19c6f752b5df9c5be53fe81e8a1de41a94da4","finding_id":"arf_v1_qtejlehzdk2o3jvi56flxym4n5","finding_key":"sdk-testing/localdurabletestrunner::resolveoperationpayload::operation-offloader-precedence","identity_key":"sdk-testing/localdurabletestrunner::resolveoperationpayload::operation-offloader-precedence","line":459,"observation_digest":"68b5b540b78866dd06c3ff8fca85048aad5e1ceffffe061eac6ef7e1ad9f83d7","observation_id":"aro_v1_nc23kqfxrbtn2bwd76h4vbierk","path":"sdk-testing/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/testing/LocalDurableTestRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-08-31T23:53:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6jkuiq4kchptxblgaj7rv7ox7x","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"596734db953690c8d41226cf4b84fde1a44d3066","reviewer":"codex","start_line":459,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_wdjs65iwc7kibi7tiwwagvbatk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-31T23:53:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
